ine-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120401088201_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260612/202606120401088201_1280.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/match1869183date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">开门红！法国3-1塞内加尔 姆巴佩双响成法国队史射手王奥利塞助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260617/zhanbao_image_1869183_1781643697_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260617/zhanbao_image_1869183_1781643697_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260617/zhanbao_image_1869183_1781643697_gray.jpeg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">姆巴佩梅开二度+世界波独占法国队史射手王，法国3-1战胜塞内加尔取得开门红，法国下轮将迎战伊拉克，塞内加尔将对阵挪威。</span></p><p><strong><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">【世界杯动态】</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/6a31b9efc8f7fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">15场14球！姆巴佩超梅西升至世界杯历史射手榜第3，距克洛泽2球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170533541678.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170533541678.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170533541678.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">在世界杯总射手榜上，克洛泽以16球高居榜首，罗纳尔多15球第二，姆巴佩目前以14球和盖德·穆勒并列第三。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/6a31b6b23f6e8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：托马斯入境加拿大申请又被驳回！他无法参加加纳世界杯首战</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.86" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170450413954_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.86" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.86" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170450413954_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170450413954_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">当地时间周二，加纳中场托马斯入境加拿大参加世界杯的相关上诉听证会在渥太华法院开庭进行，托马斯的上诉申请被加拿大方面驳回，他将无法参加世界杯对阵巴拿马的首战。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/6a31b9dd128fdnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">超越吉鲁！27岁姆巴佩99场打入58球，成为法国队史射手王！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170515381534.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170515381534.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170515381534.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">法国世界杯首战3-1塞内加尔，姆巴佩梅开二度，国家队进球达到58球，超越吉鲁的57球，成为法国队史射手王！</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/6a3192b4980e4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">时隔24年！法国世界杯首战击败塞内加尔，报韩日世界杯一箭之仇</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.39" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a31c27438a3c.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.39" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.39" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a31c27438a3c.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a31c27438a3c.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">法国队3-1击败塞内加尔，取得开门红。同时在两队相互战绩方面，法国完成了对塞内加尔的复仇。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/6a31baf79b277native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">送助攻！官方：奥利塞当选法国3-1塞内加尔全场最佳球员</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170537023852_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170537023852_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170537023852_1280.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">世界杯小组赛I组第1轮，法国3-1战胜塞内加尔，奥利塞获评全场最佳。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/6a3173d716b2cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒独家：葡萄牙主帅马丁内斯世界杯后离任，无论本届成绩如何</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170013593104.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170013593104_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170013593104_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据英媒talkSPORT名记Alex Crook独家爆料，葡萄牙队主帅罗伯特·马丁内斯将于世界杯后离任，不再续约，他的合同将于今年7月底到期。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/6a31809c81723native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡媒：伊朗队离开美国时受到严格安检 全员接受金属探测器扫描</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.25" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170059103283.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.25" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.25" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170059103283_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170059103283_720.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">据葡媒《记录报》报道，伊朗队在离开美国时，接受了严格的安检。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-17/6a3185b59f975native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：伊朗球员托拉比签证过期，可能无缘美国境内剩余世界杯赛程</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/202606170139462342_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="